# The sandbox image builds from the repository root (images/sandbox/Containerfile). Only what the
# build reads is sent, so no local file (.env, editor or agent settings) reaches even the build stage.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!.cargo
!clippy.toml
!core
!crates
!images/sandbox
**/target
**/node_modules
